WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.792
F1.2 · A tour of the interface

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.842
The interface has four fixed areas.

3
00:00:07.893 --> 00:00:12.065
The workspace tabs, the left panel, and the two sides of the top bar.

4
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.581
Click a tab to switch workspace.

5
00:00:16.631 --> 00:00:20.402
Pointing at it does nothing; the left panel follows the tab.

6
00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.547
The left of the top bar sets what you are looking at.

7
00:00:25.597 --> 00:00:29.241
The same selectors apply in FP&A and in Cash.

8
00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:32.604
Period and entities come first.

9
00:00:32.654 --> 00:00:38.195
Business unit and third party are optional: left on All when a client does not use them.

10
00:00:38.245 --> 00:00:42.551
Group reads in the group currency; Company, in each company's own.

11
00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:47.991
The right of the top bar says which company you are in, and with which role.

12
00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:50.602
Check the company before you change anything.

13
00:00:51.752 --> 00:00:55.245
Then the bell, Sync all, a second window, and auto-scroll.

14
00:00:55.295 --> 00:00:58.449
Full screen, light or dark, and sign out, in red.

15
00:00:58.499 --> 00:01:01.398
On a small screen they fold into More actions.

16
00:01:04.752 --> 00:01:09.003
Sync all refreshes every connected source, one after the other.

17
00:01:09.053 --> 00:01:12.779
Its progress shows in the button; the detail goes to the bell.

18
00:01:13.929 --> 00:01:17.898
All clear, by the page name, means the financial checks pass.

19
00:01:17.948 --> 00:01:20.225
Click it when it turns amber or red.

20
00:01:20.275 --> 00:01:24.690
Every dialog is a K-φ dialog, readable in both themes.

21
00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:30.403
Next: F1.3  Tenants, entities and reporting axes

